  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Glide to glory! Bring your A-game with the adidas Originals Handball Spezial. Designed for indoor sports in the ‘70s for elite handball players, these low-profile shoes help you dominate the court and the streets alike. The premium suede upper accented with contrast stitching adds a pop of modern elegance so you can cut and pivot with flexibility, while the gum tooling and T-toe design provide a classic, eye-catching style. From lightning-quick moves to explosive jumps, the adidas Originals Handball Spezial redefines what’s possible on the court.</p> <p><strong>adidas Originals Handball Spezial features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Regular fit offers a relaxed feel.</li> <li>Leather and synthetic materials ensure comfort and versatility.</li> <li>Lace closure ensures a snug fit.</li> <li>T-toe design adds a classic, vintage look.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Retro indoor-sport style meets easy everyday wear in the adidas Originals Handball Spezial. Originally built for handball in the '70s, this low-profile icon brings a clean, versatile look that feels just as good with jeans, shorts, or more dressed-up casual fits. A premium suede upper, signature T-toe, and gum rubber outsole keep the heritage vibe front and center while giving your rotation a timeless finish.</p> <ul> <li>Premium suede upper for a classic look and feel</li> <li>Lace closure helps you dial in the fit</li> <li>Signature T-toe design and contrast details for vintage adidas style</li> <li>Gum rubber outsole adds durable traction and old-school appeal</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the Handball Spezial feels comfortable right away and fits true to size. For the best fit, we recommend considering a half-size down if you prefer a more precise, low-profile feel, while those who like a little extra room can stick with their usual size.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday wear, long walks, and anyone who wants a classic sneaker that can shift easily from casual to slightly dressed-up looks.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>Reviewers love how easily this silhouette works across outfits, with a slim retro shape that feels polished without trying too hard. It is the kind of pair you can wear on repeat, whether the plan is a full day out, a weekend fit, or a simple everyday rotation.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Many customers find them comfortable out of the box, while some say the fit gets even better after a few wears as the upper settles in. The suede build and gum sole also get consistent praise for their quality feel.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Originals Handball Spezial - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Warm Vanilla/Off White/Dark Brown</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>KJ9974</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style